## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: API Service Layer
Extract all inline `axios.get/post/put/delete` endpoints into a clean, unified API service layer.

#### [NEW] [api.js](file:///c:/Users/anush/OneDrive/Desktop/MediFind/client/src/services/api.js)
Define unified methods for request routing:
- `authService` (`login`, `register`, `getMe`)
- `medicineService` (`search`, `add`, `delete`, `updateStock`)
- `reservationService` (`getMy`, `create`, `cancel`, `updateStatus`)
- `orderService` (`getMy`, `create`, `updateStatus`)
- `prescriptionService` (`getMy`, `upload`, `updateStatus`)

